        {
          "id": 644,
          "hub_id": 14193,
          "version": "3.1.0",
          "description": "**Fixes:**\n\n\\- empty screen when no internet connection\n\n**Features:**\n\n\\- New \"Kits\" tab: allows to add all items that are stored in your equipment builds\n\n\\- New \"Stash\" tab: see your current stash content and duplicate quickly items, since loading the image items from the cache might be slow, there is a new setting on the menu to ignore the cache\n\n\\- New \"linked search\": when opening the item details there is a new link to do a linked search. That will show in a modal which other items are compatible with it\n\nI haven't tested that much, leave a comment if you find any bug or something doesn't work as you would expect.\n\n[![stash.png](https://github.com/angel-git/give-ui/raw/master/stash.png)](https://github.com/angel-git/give-ui/raw/master/stash.png)",
          "link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1617/give-ui/3.1.0",
